# Workspace commerce config (P5-C — optional)

Config layer for **one payment model per workspace** before live PSP wiring. **Not required for Denali customer v1.**

**Nano spec:** [`TEMP/p5/p5-c-workspace-commerce-config.md`](../../TEMP/p5/p5-c-workspace-commerce-config.md)

---

## Denali scope (frozen)

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Payment mode | **`offline_receipt` only** — no Super Admin toggle |
| Flow | Member upload → admin review (existing finance routes) |
| P5-C UI | Commerce badge **hidden or read-only** for `workspaceType=denali` |

---

## Schema (non-Denali workspaces)

```json
{
  "commerce": {
    "paymentMode": "offline_receipt",
    "gatewayProvider": null,
    "currency": "IRR"
  }
}
```

Gateway values blocked until P5-D exit (`GU-02` spec).

---

## Verify

```bash
pnpm run guard:p3-denali-covenant
pnpm --filter @apps/api exec node --import tsx --test \
  test/denali-offline-receipt-unchanged.spec.ts \
  test/workspace-commerce-single-mode.spec.ts
```
